Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get what you really want.\NI want more. Any one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like the wind, jump high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.73,0:00:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.22,0:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going on the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.52,0:00:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what you're making my dream? Time to?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.02,0:00:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is\NSomething is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.54,0:01:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.92,0:01:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away the crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know there are no rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.46,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.44,0:01:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Only without.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.42,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you don't want to\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like the wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.02,0:01:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you cannot achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.12,0:01:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your wife that I\Nwant, but you're where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life,\Nshine like a star to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.64,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong. Just\Nthat you gotta keep your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.58,0:02:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This voice is a real sensitive issue!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck it off or he's gonna\Nflip out and kill us too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:03:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves, because we're about to\Nget punched by a whole freaking castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel that there's trouble looming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.76,0:03:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral, a monster is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.72,0:03:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.38,0:03:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, you really gotta stop\Nscrewing with every enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,See, it's so hard not to crack up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't gonna be pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I'd know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.70,0:04:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Even further from the\Npalace, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.14,0:04:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That stone bastard's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Never thought we'd see someone\Nbigger than oars, but here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to even fight\Nsomething that size, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirate hunter Zoro I\Npresume and you Trafalgar
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.96,0:04:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You disgusting worst generation scoundrel,\Nwhy do you steal all the glory from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.06,0:04:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop yelling!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.52,0:04:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to beef with my crewmate or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not in your crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me guess, you still\Ngot a grudge against us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:04:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:05:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall no longer be a\Nthreat to the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Because your brave crewmate, God Usopp,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.44,0:05:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,selflessly saved me from\Na life of doom and gloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp did that? That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget his valiant deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He boldly risked everything in order\Nto spare the lives of hundreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.06,0:05:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.97,0:05:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Chucks, it's nice to hear\Nyou compliment my crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.78,0:05:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar, I believe this is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.12,0:05:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I happened upon it\Noutside of the Coliseum.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've been longing for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Lend me your head a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.36,0:05:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't trust you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.20,0:05:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.11,0:05:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I'd waste any more time on\Nyou, I have a schedule to maintain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.64,0:05:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to\Ninquire why I'm so busy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.15,0:05:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I have decided to repay my debt to your\Ncrew by seizing the head of Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Seek shelter in dirt or whatever you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.08,0:05:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall handle these matters as tribute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.03,0:05:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to do it myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:06:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I already decided this is how I'm going\Nto pay back Rebecca for buying me lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.26,0:06:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going head to head\Nwith a warlord over some food?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.04,0:06:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't fall for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you lie to my face?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.40,0:06:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just trying to take out Doflamingo\Nfor the fame and riches that follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.38,0:06:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds like you, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ponder it a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He who brings down the\Ndastardly ghost flamingo will
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.72,0:06:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,make headlines ensuring the\Nwhole world turns their head!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.96,0:06:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Imagine the crowds clamoring to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.44,0:06:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.35,0:06:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Superstar Playboy extraordinaire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just Superstar will suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.02,0:06:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to be formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.02,0:06:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your opinion regarding\Npiracy in recent years?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.30,0:06:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm having trouble seeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.14,0:06:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Cavendish, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm standing here in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're shining so bright we can't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you turn down your aura?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it too intense for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.42,0:06:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize, but I cannot\Nsuppress my brilliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.30,0:06:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he really is a superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please feel free to bask\Nin my glory. Take it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.08,0:07:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.22,0:07:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep searching for Straw Hat's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.06,0:07:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,After a punch like that, he might\Nhave been crushed to smithereens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.60,0:07:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps he got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.78,0:07:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know if the\Nlittle maggot's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll squash you flat\Nbefore you get to Dorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.00,0:07:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.50,0:07:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandson of God, wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been looking for you, rubber boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.84,0:08:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, not so!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.82,0:08:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We should go! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's getting into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But we told him to wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got more company?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.50,0:08:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's away already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Head on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something wrong with\Nyour hearing, grandson of Garp?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.02,0:08:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hear this old man out for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:09:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to let you know I've forgiven\Nthe grudge I held against your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.18,0:09:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here for one thing, and that's to\Neliminate Doflamingo's immoral business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.06,0:09:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't care about the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A puny bounty like that\Nis mere change for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I must thank you and your friend for the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,brave god Usopp rescued\Nme in my darkest hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.78,0:09:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Decided to repay my debt\Nto the Straw Hats by
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,obliterating Doflamingo and his\Nwicked monarchy. Huh? You two?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.50,0:09:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The only guy who's kicking his ass is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.86,0:09:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The nerve of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you rejecting my generous favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, I was searching for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we buried a hatchet between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.62,0:09:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear as a proud warrior of Elbath,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.80,0:09:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll slay Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.32,0:09:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but guard Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.62,0:09:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We of the Prodent's kingdom have\Nlong owed King Rick an enormous debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring down Doflamingo\Nwith my own two fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, his majesty's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't want the bounty, not this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.04,0:10:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We will be the ones who kill that bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.72,0:10:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall never forget that beacon of\Nlight, who freed us from our torment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.32,0:10:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us repay his valor. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.12,0:10:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you do this without me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.36,0:10:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Destruction's my specialty!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can leave the execution to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.68,0:10:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one to take his life
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.58,0:10:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You really attract some oddballs, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.12,0:10:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd be a fool to forget me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, Big Mouth found us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.22,0:10:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what if we do it this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.94,0:11:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Us two will handle killing Doflamingo\NWhile you guys watch our backs, sound okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.08,0:11:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill Go Flamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.66,0:11:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There are way too many egos involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.18,0:11:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm making\Nthe call, so listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone here's gonna kick his ass like\Nit needs to be kicked, it's gonna be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.62,0:11:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting this favor\Nreturned one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.96,0:11:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you save someone's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.72,0:11:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,you better learn to accept their\Nkindness or else, you moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.84,0:11:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! Guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.26,0:11:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My pride!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.74,0:11:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The team!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, savior!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.24,0:11:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's where they were!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you think we could get in on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Splitting up all those\Nbounties could go a long way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:11:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:12:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't they look kind of familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They were toys at the dock just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Those shapeless cowards, how dare they?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.18,0:12:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get that bounty!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.48,0:12:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You ungrateful swine!\NI'll see you in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.92,0:12:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.98,0:12:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A cow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.66,0:12:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.52,0:12:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, bull!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.66,0:12:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.80,0:12:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I've located the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Master Pika!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.86,0:12:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They came right to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.24,0:12:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.14,0:12:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They're riding a bull!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got eyes on three.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:13:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, I mean, four, five, six, seven!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.62,0:13:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.32,0:13:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I said get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He brought an army?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did they come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I've got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.90,0:13:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You all can stand down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.48,0:13:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't hesitate to slice you all\Ninto pieces if you get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.12,0:13:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be my privilege. No, mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he get so many\Nallies on such short notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.90,0:13:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't those some of the\Ncompetitors from the Coliseum?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll crush as many of you as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Drill Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I'm not fully charged up\Nyet, I got a light one for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.32,0:13:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,King Punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nailed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.43,0:13:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.52,0:14:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They shattered his arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.86,0:14:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We can consider this our practice round\Nfor when we finally get to Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.28,0:14:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Moose off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.36,0:14:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You ungrateful savior!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.18,0:14:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That serves you right,\Nyou big whiny brood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.72,0:14:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, giddy up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.38,0:14:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Moosey! Easy, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I told you, you're not invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.80,0:14:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off of Moosey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.94,0:14:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Straw Hat, let us in on the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:14:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Moosey, tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.70,0:15:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the justice\None, you little bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.90,0:15:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't let them get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.84,0:15:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,They're heading straight for the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me jump in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.88,0:15:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Giddy-o, the champion fighter!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.38,0:15:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about me already?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.34,0:15:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Destruction King!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Better send in some big guns,\Notherwise there's no stopping me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys are crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.38,0:15:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Commodore Olympus!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.92,0:15:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were you, I'd get\Nout of my way, Commodore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.32,0:15:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.10,0:15:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Blade of Beauty, Swan Lake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:15:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,there's trouble on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.84,0:16:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,he's gonna throw another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.44,0:16:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,not again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.54,0:16:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it's round two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,i wouldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you obviously don't know\Nwhat you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.48,0:16:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,here his arms grow back even\Nif you break him ten times.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,stop wasting energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.08,0:16:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,suggest we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,i say we flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.36,0:16:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,you're a paid professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.92,0:16:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you really got nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,retreating is a valid strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you want to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.38,0:16:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,running at him head on is not viable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.02,0:16:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,let's take a detour.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.40,0:16:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,how do we get through him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,we won't make it to the\Npalace at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.40,0:16:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Straw Hat run off to, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost sight of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.64,0:16:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He may have been pulverized.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.54,0:16:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.72,0:17:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.88,0:17:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.42,0:17:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.96,0:17:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.82,0:17:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't upstage me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.52,0:17:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't expect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's ride to the palace in style!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.58,0:17:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.49,0:17:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pastor Moosey, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.40,0:17:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.53,0:17:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my ball, stowaways! So? Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're weighing Moosey down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.40,0:17:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right, excuse us for not\Nintroducing ourselves sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.92,0:17:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Jeet and the\Nbig fellow behind me is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Abdulla, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:17:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks pissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.56,0:18:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get near Dolphy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,His arm's growing back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Strawhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.82,0:18:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Grizzly Madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.28,0:18:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,His head broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.94,0:18:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Or Pika!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.10,0:18:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.86,0:18:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We never doubted you, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.44,0:18:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We knew you should do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.84,0:18:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.88,0:18:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you should be\Ncelebrating just yet, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.60,0:18:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.28,0:18:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The head you shattered\Nwas just a stone decoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means Squeaky got away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.00,0:18:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.10,0:18:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:18:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,His real body's up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.46,0:19:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, there's a guy inside the big rock guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.62,0:19:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first time we're\Nactually seeing him in the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.14,0:19:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a huge katana.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.28,0:19:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not too late to turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.94,0:19:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You ever say this too, Moosey?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.02,0:19:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.93,0:19:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.04,0:19:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.72,0:19:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The bull can fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.28,0:19:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.46,0:19:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That voice still gets me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:19:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.16,0:20:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.42,0:20:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.46,0:20:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,God, that's such bad-ass friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.30,0:20:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go give Mingo\Nthe beating he deserves!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.48,0:20:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You go get him, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a score to settle! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to fight me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.98,0:20:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He has better things to do than\Ntangle with a pebble like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal with it, Soprano Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.72,0:20:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all that you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.60,0:20:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That monster stopped dead in its\Ntracks! Is he dead? Doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.04,0:20:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's far too convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.02,0:21:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, it seems like those annoying\Npunches of his have ceased for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.94,0:21:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's strike while we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.26,0:21:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The flamingos shall die by\Nmy hand! No mine! No mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.92,0:21:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this, Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep it up! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.94,0:21:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Mozzarella!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.66,0:21:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Moosey is my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want one, then get\Noff and find your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.52,0:21:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a kidder!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We love you, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.88,0:21:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Straw Hat, I realize we have\Nno choice but to kill do flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.64,0:21:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.56,0:21:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that's not the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.04,0:21:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggested before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.06,0:21:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we could get away\Nwith a less direct approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But to be perfectly honest with you, I\Nwant to make him suffer with my own hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.86,0:21:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let him defeat me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.60,0:22:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a person I cared for deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And Doflamigo killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,His name was Corazon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a former top executive\Nin the Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.86,0:22:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Doflamingo killed his own friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Corazon was the man who saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.28,0:22:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Doflamingo, he was more than\Njust a member of the Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He was his younger brother.
